/P 240 0 R
/E (I have learned a great deal not only from the project my teammate and I completed, but also from the events I have attended. I have learned that creating synthetic datasets is difficult, especially when I want them to offer user freedom and still mimic real-life scenarios. During the actual coding part of the algorithm, my teammate and I encountered some hurdles where we were stuck and unsure how to even begin coding this. However, from the events that I was able to attend, I have learned that with the current capabilities of AI, almost anything can be built as long as the prompts are optimized. Thus, I leveraged its power in order to create the algorithm.)
